---
source: crates/m2-server-core/tests/scenarios.rs
expression: h.log
---
-- the provider did not confirm the sign-in: refused, the connection closed
@1000 conn#1 accepted on auth from 10.0.0.1
   -> event: conn#1: accepted on auth
@1000 conn#1 sends Hello protocol=4 "openm2 test"
   -> event: conn#1: openm2 test speaks protocol 4
   -> send conn#1 Welcome protocol=4
@1000 conn#1 sends StartSignIn
   -> send conn#1 SignInOptions [example] nonce="f400927857aaf64114f561baacb37970"
@1000 conn#1 sends ProviderLogin example http://127.0.0.1:50000/callback
   -> check sign-in #1: example http://127.0.0.1:50000/callback nonce=f400927857aaf64114f561baacb37970
@1000 sign-in #1 refused: Refused
   -> event: conn#1: login refused: the provider did not confirm the sign-in
   -> send conn#1 LoginRefused 6
   -> close conn#1
   -> event: conn#1: closed: the provider did not confirm the sign-in
-- a provider the server does not offer: refused before the edge sees it
@1000 conn#2 accepted on auth from 10.0.0.1
   -> event: conn#2: accepted on auth
@1000 conn#2 sends Hello protocol=4 "openm2 test"
   -> event: conn#2: openm2 test speaks protocol 4
   -> send conn#2 Welcome protocol=4
@1000 conn#2 sends StartSignIn
   -> send conn#2 SignInOptions [example] nonce="8c79a1dc1476ab573216a4020764bde5"
@1000 conn#2 sends ProviderLogin other http://127.0.0.1:50000/callback
   -> event: conn#2: login refused: a sign-in the server cannot check
   -> send conn#2 LoginRefused 6
   -> close conn#2
   -> event: conn#2: closed: a sign-in the server cannot check
-- the provider could not be reached: not counted
@1000 conn#3 accepted on auth from 10.0.0.1
   -> event: conn#3: accepted on auth
@1000 conn#3 sends Hello protocol=4 "openm2 test"
   -> event: conn#3: openm2 test speaks protocol 4
   -> send conn#3 Welcome protocol=4
@1000 conn#3 sends StartSignIn
   -> send conn#3 SignInOptions [example] nonce="45c143dbb9609c22ab855d60925a9976"
@1000 conn#3 sends ProviderLogin example http://127.0.0.1:50000/callback
   -> check sign-in #2: example http://127.0.0.1:50000/callback nonce=45c143dbb9609c22ab855d60925a9976
@1000 sign-in #2 refused: Unavailable
   -> event: conn#3: login refused: the provider could not be reached
   -> send conn#3 LoginRefused 7
   -> close conn#3
   -> event: conn#3: closed: the provider could not be reached
