-- a minute later it works
@61000 tick
@61000 conn#8 accepted on auth from 10.0.0.1
   -> event: conn#8: accepted on auth
@61000 conn#8 sends Hello protocol=4 "openm2 test"
   -> event: conn#8: openm2 test speaks protocol 4
   -> send conn#8 Welcome protocol=4
@61000 conn#8 sends StartSignIn
   -> send conn#8 SignInOptions [example] nonce="f5e0e5dfefb6897bbd7460315e81182a"
@61000 conn#8 sends ProviderLogin example http://127.0.0.1:50000/callback
   -> check sign-in #6: example http://127.0.0.1:50000/callback nonce=f5e0e5dfefb6897bbd7460315e81182a
@61000 sign-in #6 checked: https://id.example alice
   -> store #7: identity login example https://id.example alice
@61000 store answers #7: login ok, account 1 None
   -> event: conn#8: account 1 signed in with example
   -> send conn#8 SignedIn example:alice c2be… (32 bytes)
-- a second sign-in while the first is in game: in game
@61000 conn#9 accepted on auth from 10.0.0.1
   -> event: conn#9: accepted on auth
@61000 conn#9 sends Hello protocol=4 "openm2 test"
   -> event: conn#9: openm2 test speaks protocol 4
   -> send conn#9 Welcome protocol=4
@61000 conn#9 sends StartSignIn
   -> send conn#9 SignInOptions [example] nonce="c82fb56107fe74a0d3679f844d9b0a20"
